SUMMARY:Digital Health Canada/RSN Montreal 2026 Breakfast
DESCRIPTION:Let’s discuss the future of digital health in Canada over breakfast. Digital Health Canada’s MTL26 Breakfast Event\, presented in partnership with RSN (Réseau santé numérique)\, will identify common challenges and opportunities from across Canada\, with a focus on Quebec innovation. Learn about local innovation programs and opportunities\, and gain insights into digital health partnerships and collaborations from other provinces to spark new ideas and drive progress in Quebec and beyond. \nThe Breakfast will take place in Montreal\, Quebec on Tuesday\, October 27\, 2026. \nPresented by\n\n		\n		\n			\n				\n			\n			\n				\n			\n			\n		\n\nRegister\n\nMember Regular: $155\nNon-Member Regular: $185\nStudent: $50\n\nSend your team and save with bundle pricing \n\nMember Ticket Bundle (5 tickets): $685\nMember Ticket Bundle (10 tickets): $1\,370\nMember Ticket Bundles (25 tickets): $3\,225\nMember Ticket Bundles (50 tickets): $6\,075\n\nREGISTER \n\nTell others about the event\nDownload any of the images below to share on social media.
URL:https://digitalhealthcanada.com/event-calendar/digital-health-canada-mtl26/
LOCATION:Plaza Centre-Ville\, 777 Blvd Robert Bourassa\, Montreal\, Québec\, H3C 3Z7\, Canada
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://digitalhealthcanada.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/MTL26-Event-Header.png
END:VEVENT
