SUMMARY:FHIR North 2026
DESCRIPTION:Join us virtually on October 27 & 28 as we explore the future of healthcare interoperability. \nWe’re excited to welcome you to FHIR North 2026\, where we are shifting the lens from theoretical data standards to widespread\, real-world implementation. This year\, we will dive deep into how organizations are moving past localized pilots to build resilient\, connected health systems. Join us to unpack the practical strategies\, infrastructure insights\, and scaling policies needed to make FHIR function sustainably across diverse systems and sectors. \nFHIR North 2026\nOctober 27 – 28\, 2026\nZoom Events Platform \nNetworking Event in Toronto\nOctober 28 | 6:30pm \nJoin us to meet other like-minded FHIR professionals\, to mingle and network. Light hors d’oeuvres will be provided. \nSpace is limited. Tickets are required. Learn more here.
URL:https://digitalhealthcanada.com/event-calendar/fhir-north-26/
LOCATION:Online
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://digitalhealthcanada.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/FHIR-North.png
END:VEVENT
