SUMMARY:Connected Content\, Connected Care: Building a Unified Digital Health Record
DESCRIPTION:This session explores how healthcare organizations can reduce information fragmentation by adopting an enterprise content management (ECM) strategy. Attendees will learn how intelligent capture\, archival of legacy data\, systems integrations\, and records governance create a unified record that improves clinician access\, operational efficiency\, compliance\, and digital transformation outcomes. \nOctober Webinar Wednesdays are sponsored by Quest Diagnostics
URL:https://digitalhealthcanada.com/event-calendar/connected-content-connected-care/
LOCATION:Online
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://digitalhealthcanada.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/26-27-event-header-ww-9.png
END:VEVENT
