SUMMARY:Digital Health Canada Office Hours Online
DESCRIPTION:Do you have questions? We have answers!\nEvery Thursday\, Digital Health Canada representatives are online to answer questions about membership\, events\, education—ask us anything! No registration required. Drop in anytime between 12–1:00 p.m. ET. \n\nJoin Zoom Meeting: https://us02web.zoom.us/j/89990442155?pwd=YRwpCo7NspjNzKSuCv4S2w4j6ai8Ia.1 \nJoin and take notes: https://us02web.zoom.us/j/89990442155?pwd=YRwpCo7NspjNzKSuCv4S2w4j6ai8Ia.1&mynotes=on\nMeeting chat link: https://us02web.zoom.us/launch/jc/89990442155\nMeeting ID: 899 9044 2155\nPasscode: 631840\nOne tap mobile: +15873281099\,\,89990442155# Canada / +16473744685\,\,89990442155# Canada\nJoin by SIP: 89990442155@zoomcrc.com\nJoin instructions: https://us02web.zoom.us/meetings/89990442155/invitations?signature=mvwXie5NwOOj8Lb6VPQVA2e7IzrgNCd2vSapxff7vXw
